cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ExaMLOps in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "ExaMLOps: End-to-End MLOps Platform for HPC Workload Management"
abstract: >-
  ExaMLOps is an end-to-end, open-source MLOps platform for HPC (high-performance
  computing) workload management. It runs the full machine-learning lifecycle —
  auto-discovery training pipelines (Prefect), Slurm job orchestration, an MLflow
  model registry with a multi-stage lifecycle, Ray Serve multi-model serving,
  Prometheus/Grafana/Loki observability, a React 19 + FastAPI dashboard, a
  LangGraph management agent ("Skipper"), and the `exa` platform CLI — on
  Slurm-based clusters used in large European research projects.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Seyedkazemi Ardebili"
    given-names: "Mohsen"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MSKazemi/ExaMLOps"
url: "https://github.com/MSKazemi/ExaMLOps"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - MLOps
  - HPC
  - Slurm
  - MLflow
  - Prefect
  - Ray Serve
  - model registry
  - machine learning
  - LangGraph
  - FastAPI
